---
// src/pages/indian-sgpa-calculator.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import IndianSgpaCalculator from '../components/IndianSgpaCalculator.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Indian SGPA Calculator | Semester Grade Point Average (CBCS)"
  description="Free Indian SGPA calculator for university and engineering students. Calculate semester grade point average with UGC 10-point letter grades and course credits."
>
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 960px; padding-top: 2.5rem; padding-bottom: 5rem;">
    <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem;">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--color-mute);">
        <a href="/" style="color: var(--color-mute); text-decoration: none;">Home</a>
        <span style="margin: 0 0.5rem; color: var(--color-hairline);">&gt;</span>
        <span style="color: var(--color-ink); font-weight: 500;">Indian SGPA Calculator</span>
      </nav>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem;">
        <a href="/indian-cgpa-calculator" class="btn btn-secondary btn-pill" style="font-size: 0.8125rem; text-decoration: none;">
          CGPA Calculator &rarr;
        </a>
        <a href="/semester-cgpa-calculator" class="btn btn-secondary btn-pill" style="font-size: 0.8125rem; text-decoration: none;">
          All Semesters &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Header Section -->
    <header style="margin-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-hairline); padding-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      <span class="mono-eyebrow" style="color: var(--color-blue); margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">Semester Grade Point Average</span>
      <h1 class="heading-lg" style="color: var(--color-ink); font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4vw, 2.5rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-top: 0.25rem;">
        Indian SGPA Calculator
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--color-body); margin-top: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 780px;">
        Accurately calculate your term SGPA under the Choice Based Credit System (CBCS). Enter your registered subjects, credits, and UGC letter grades (O, A+, A, B+, B, C, P, F) to compute your exact semester standing.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Interactive Calculator -->
    <section style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <IndianSgpaCalculator idPrefix="page-sgpa" />
    </section>

    <!-- Guide & Formula Section -->
    <article class="geist-card" style="padding: 2.25rem 2rem; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-body); margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 class="heading-md" style="color: var(--color-ink); font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        Understanding Semester Grade Point Average (SGPA)
      </h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        In Indian higher education, each semester is evaluated as an independent academic milestone. The <strong>SGPA (Semester Grade Point Average)</strong> reflects the ratio of total quality points earned across all registered subjects in that specific term to the total credit hours registered.
      </p>

      <h3 class="heading-md" style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        Official UGC / CBCS Formula
      </h3>
      <div style="background: var(--color-canvas-subtle); padding: 1rem 1.25rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); border: 1px solid var(--color-hairline); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.875rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
        SGPA (S<sub>i</sub>) = &Sigma;(C<sub>i</sub> &times; G<sub>i</sub>) &divide; &Sigma;C<sub>i</sub>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        Where:
      </p>
      <ul style="padding-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
        <li><strong>C<sub>i</sub></strong> = Number of credits assigned to the <em>i</em>-th course in that semester.</li>
        <li><strong>G<sub>i</sub></strong> = Grade point secured by the student in the <em>i</em>-th course (0 to 10).</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="heading-md" style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        How SGPA Impacts Final Cumulative CGPA
      </h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        Your cumulative degree grade (CGPA) is not a simple arithmetic average of your semester SGPAs unless every semester had an identical credit total. Instead, your degree CGPA is calculated as a credit-weighted composite:
      </p>
      <div style="background: var(--color-canvas-subtle); padding: 1rem 1.25rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); border: 1px solid var(--color-hairline); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.875rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
        Cumulative CGPA = &Sigma;(SGPA<sub>j</sub> &times; Semester Credits<sub>j</sub>) &divide; &Sigma;(Semester Credits<sub>j</sub>)
      </div>
      <p>
        Therefore, higher-credit semesters (e.g. semesters with 26 credits including major project or multiple labs) exert significantly more influence on your final graduating CGPA than lighter terms.
      </p>
    </article>

    <!-- FAQs -->
    <section class="faq-card" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <h2 class="heading-md" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-ink);">
        Frequently Asked Questions
      </h2>
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-question">What happens if I fail (get an 'F' grade) in a subject?</div>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            An 'F' (Fail) carries 0 grade points. The course's registered credits remain in the denominator, which severely lowers your SGPA for that semester. When you clear the subject in a supplementary or backlog examination, your updated grade point replaces the 0 in subsequent CGPA recalculations according to university rules.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-question">How can I combine multiple semester SGPAs into a single CGPA?</div>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Use our <a href="/semester-cgpa-calculator" style="color: var(--color-blue); text-decoration: underline;">Semester-wise CGPA Calculator</a> to input your individual SGPAs from Semester 1 through Semester 8 alongside their respective credit totals.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Related Links -->
    <section>
      <h3 class="heading-md" style="margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--color-ink);">Related Calculators</h3>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem;">
        <a href="/semester-cgpa-calculator" class="geist-card" style="padding: 1.25rem; text-decoration: none; display: block;">
          <h4 style="font-size: 0.9375rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Semester-wise CGPA</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--color-mute); line-height: 1.4;">Calculate overall CGPA across Semesters 1 to 8.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/indian-cgpa-calculator" class="geist-card" style="padding: 1.25rem; text-decoration: none; display: block;">
          <h4 style="font-size: 0.9375rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Indian CGPA Calculator</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--color-mute); line-height: 1.4;">Comprehensive UGC 10-point subject calculator.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/cgpa-to-percentage" class="geist-card" style="padding: 1.25rem; text-decoration: none; display: block;">
          <h4 style="font-size: 0.9375rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">CGPA to Percentage</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--color-mute); line-height: 1.4;">Convert SGPA or CGPA into marks percentage.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/target-cgpa-calculator" class="geist-card" style="padding: 1.25rem; text-decoration: none; display: block;">
          <h4 style="font-size: 0.9375rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-ink); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Target CGPA Planner</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--color-mute); line-height: 1.4;">Plan future semester performance goals.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
